    "created_at": "2017-09-25T10:08:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-25T10:08:47Z",
    "body": "FWIW I think there is a use case for some permissions prompting on load, e.g. geolocation permission for a maps app. I think the notifications permission is a special case with no use case for prompting on load and is already being abused. I have no opinion if other permissions end up requiring a user gesture, but I only intended to affect the notifications API in this issue.",
