    "created_at": "2019-08-26T12:01:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-26T12:01:07Z",
    "body": "We have been experimenting with this [since earlier this year](https://blog.nightly.mozilla.org/2019/04/01/reducing-notification-permission-prompt-spam-in-firefox/) on Firefox Nightly and are seeing good results. We'll summarize and publish our findings once our final study on Release users ends (it ends in September).\r\n\r\nIn almost 4 months of running this on Nightly, we have gotten exactly 0 complaints about sites not working, while we greatly increased the allow ratio.\r\n\r\nAgain, this is not a final announcement, just a short progress report, with more updates coming soon.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
